roduct</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/compare/v80.9.0...v83.0.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility\nscore](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=setuptools&package-manager=uv&previous-version=80.9.0&new-version=83.0.0)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't\nalter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting\n`@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits\nthat have been made to it\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all\nof the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the\nPR or upgrade to it yourself)\nYou can disable automated security fix PRs for this repo from the\n[Security Alerts\npage](https://github.com/langchain-ai/langgraph/network/alerts).\n\n</details>\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-25T07:33:44Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/commits/9f1e40bfeea28dee2155b4a57f5babd0a53534cf","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langgraph/commit/9f1e40bfeea28dee2155b4a57f5babd0a53534cf","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/commits/9f1e40bfeea28dee2155b4a57f5babd0a53534cf/comments","author":{"login":"dependabot[bot]","id":49699333,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"1e1ca88dad9c7e708263257fa9fc27a3fbdfff68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/commits/1e1ca88dad9c7e708263257fa9fc27a3fbdfff68","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langgraph/commit/1e1ca88dad9c7e708263257fa9fc27a3fbdfff68"}]},{"sha":"1e1ca88dad9c7e708263257fa9fc27a3fbdfff68","node_id":"C_kwDOKFU0ldoAKDFlMWNhODhkYWQ5YzdlNzA4MjYzMjU3ZmE5ZmMyN2EzZmJkZmZmNjg","commit":{"author":{"name":"Nick Hollon","email":"nick.hollon@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-24T17:16:41Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-24T17:16:41Z"},"message":"feat(langgraph): type v3 stream_events return and native projections (#8389)\n\nThe `version=\"v3\"` overloads of `stream_events`/`astream_events`\nreturned `Any`, and `GraphRunStream`/`AsyncGraphRunStream` attached\nnative projections via a runtime `setattr` loop invisible to type\ncheckers.\n\n- Return `GraphRunStream` / `Awaitable[AsyncGraphRunStream]` from the v3\noverloads.\n- Declare the always-registered native projections (`values`,\n`messages`, `lifecycle`, `subgraphs`) as typed class attributes on both\nrun streams.\n- Add `assert_type` checks in `test_stream_events_v3.py`.\n\nOpt-in native projections (`updates`, `custom`, `checkpoints`, `debug`,\n`tasks`) are only present when their transformer is registered, so they\nremain reached via `extensions[...]` rather than annotated as\nalways-present.","tree":{"sha":"f43da903ca3c83a37c42c96b46c81c3f23b54a81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/git/trees/f43da903ca3c83a37c42c96b46c81c3f23b54a81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/git/commits/1e1ca88dad9c7e708263257fa9fc27a3fbdfff68","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqY535CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADgkQACNiJdntWQ0TTJXPTAqwvAaO\n/sSpJ3Pe1U6CGyhYvf/as35H39CS2JROOdfFPLXs2j+QPUjDS0Dm+JzGNeYGBTHL\n+tGH8tj2/fs9XcrXeAPK/R5PqZB4qqFNmP0izGQMABPk8lpdkOmKWZFJ22t3Ke/D\n0ClxOL5sHSir2jo9CZVCM5bo1FDjRd+Qxhn5n19r5e/JErwB5zE9jKF9SS6ywMbn\nY6dRPBRL1vv+5d1pHcXOlrWLr2ejyUagQT2JBIR+XkW0MXl/zZQNz9i9/lPzQETi\nnAdo6DfjCz8Q6eb0bTrzPLcWu1uiL+EWFa3UiCq4H1x738MhrbdPROGmKFuObJj5\nHVLy1bOhRQteNZhQmsJviwS9GQbOvRJlQGpgOjiZTxA5EERTL1N651xDI0Ux8isC\nuRpbJxIn7idvE8gI/Xm5QEJW1ov/7rJRHGEuaIa68dtkImhHSjpOF1AEfY8whkWy\niia1Mq2KaW+98iwxi79K/iYAuWqzpckh71LHUqz3P706Y/4nDRDTFIi6MEPIb7xv\nv1BcNrKOd7t+GBO3Ri2rOaEX6pVlk3FEBpDk9pAzmmSFkZ1ME/mGXqFXeYRJcK7L\nGYC3mspxby1up0SJyKBKdMWKpJpz6gN17lefEaseOigHhTy8d1jT3+Rop4M8pxhT\npn16duE2tabQAiKctntr\n=nA5U\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree f43da903ca3c83a37c42c96b46c81c3f23b54a81\nparent 31f90df3e6b0268fa77fd2d118a917d420b84a68\nauthor Nick Hollon <nick.hollon@langchain.dev> 1784913401 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784913401 -0400\n\nfeat(langgraph): type v3 stream_events return and native projections (#8389)\n\nThe `version=\"v3\"` overloads of `stream_events`/`astream_events`\nreturned `Any`, and `GraphRunStream`/`AsyncGraphRunStream` attached\nnative projections via a runtime `setattr` loop invisible to type\ncheckers.\n\n- Return `GraphRunStream` / `Awaitable[AsyncGraphRunStream]` from the v3\noverloads.\n- Declare the always-registered native projections (`values`,\n`messages`, `lifecycle`, `subgraphs`) as typed class attributes on both\nrun streams.\n- Add `assert_type` checks in `test_stream_events_v3.py`.\n\nOpt-in native projections (`updates`, `custom`, `checkpoints`, `debug`,\n`tasks`) are only present when their transformer is registered, so they\nremain reached via `extensions[...]` rather than annotated as\nalways-present.","verified_at":"2026-07-24T17:16:41Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/commits/1e1ca88dad9c7e708263257fa9fc27a3fbdfff68","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langgraph/commit/1e1ca88dad9c7e708263257fa9fc27a3fbdfff68","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/commits/1e1ca88dad9c7e708263257fa9fc27a3fbdfff68/comments","author":{"login":"nick-hollon-lc","id":274035459,"node_id":"U_kgDOEFVzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274035459?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc","html_url":"https://github.com/nick-hollon-lc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"ht