,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/commits/3df6f50ad545e1c81fa14bc172784185aabf11ce","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langgraph/commit/3df6f50ad545e1c81fa14bc172784185aabf11ce","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/commits/3df6f50ad545e1c81fa14bc172784185aabf11ce/comments","author":{"login":"hari-dhanushkodi","id":203702815,"node_id":"U_kgDODCRCHw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203702815?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hari-dhanushkodi","html_url":"https://github.com/hari-dhanushkodi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hari-dhanushkodi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hari-dhanushkodi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hari-dhanushkodi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hari-dhanushkodi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hari-dhanushkodi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hari-dhanushkodi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hari-dhanushkodi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hari-dhanushkodi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hari-dhanushkodi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"8c9d59c842454e7f4531f5e69ff9dab0af3c660f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/commits/8c9d59c842454e7f4531f5e69ff9dab0af3c660f","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langgraph/commit/8c9d59c842454e7f4531f5e69ff9dab0af3c660f"}]},{"sha":"8c9d59c842454e7f4531f5e69ff9dab0af3c660f","node_id":"C_kwDOKFU0ldoAKDhjOWQ1OWM4NDI0NTRlN2Y0NTMxZjVlNjlmZjlkYWIwYWYzYzY2MGY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Quanzheng Long","email":"long@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-23T18:56:11Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-23T18:56:11Z"},"message":"fix(langgraph): emit valid UUIDs for exit-mode delta task_ids for langgraph-api (#8165)\n\nFix exit-mode DeltaChannel `PutWrites` task IDs so they remain valid RFC\nUUIDs while preserving superstep ordering for `ORDER BY task_id, idx`.\n\nFollow-up to #7730: `_put_exit_delta_writes` used `f\"{step:08d}-{tid}\"`,\nwhich produces a 6-segment string Postgres rejects for\n`checkpoint_writes.task_id uuid` (e.g. `invalid input syntax for type\nuuid`) in LangGraph-API.\n\nThis new `exit_delta_task_id()` helper embeds the superstep in the first\nUUID group and keeps the original task UUID in the remaining segments\n(e.g. `00000001-0270-bf16-1ef8-fb321bef9f3d`).\n\n**Breaking changes:** None.\n\n**Verification:**\n- `cd libs/langgraph && make format && make lint && make test\nTEST=\"tests/test_delta_channel_exit_mode.py\"` (12 passed)\n- New unit test asserts synthetic IDs parse as UUID, sort by superstep,\nand that the old format is invalid\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Quanzheng Long <prclqz@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <215916821+open-swe[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"88860d154a480edf389a555c23a9c9ad6a352425","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/git/trees/88860d154a480edf389a555c23a9c9ad6a352425"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/git/commits/8c9d59c842454e7f4531f5e69ff9dab0af3c660f","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOtbLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlWwQADo8OGlo2nkkUF/hjpB+T4Eo\nrAc4QXvxnLryPyQ4ejH4PiWNSdZfQaB42/1n4EibNiFFh+IDcc5ujUNiD4qtGvXj\nQpUfFDRAZRvP60MvB43Uysr28pOsaJQHRet5gEyrPh80q35i0ldPXfpdwC9i3diI\npqJdMPCvH/hL/OzXHkcmY3yPtVxkP+vvhTaYThyTfTiTCsHhMgJbzzBPeh4Jp4FC\n1HxXPcgOeQwGK/+bNojt8y3PLff3XDi+rT/CXryy2p39iPwpkhHF/vk/GKmMdKfQ\nG0A6Y3eJ/YTstiuAqUnpcJHhZk40YBostHahn+SS4Ynggii9kz4yJlI6hcKSVnp/\nkkTZNJRYDy8nk9qcONwbQgRou6WKuRMqoSfCiWf44nDDAdVtNsW0Yf+7umgw16xa\neoATmlPGu7/Ti8HkLmBFwgmyLCpQzv+Wm3XEDEVBLv4URZT6zCL+2KT6u7/Gey/p\nyLAxCPQMrKwm3yOGtfsy5cTED92Qy74JkA5/spzxViROShiEnHB/GxmLFVyeEiZZ\nmxIayWKcicDVZ60yxl10/MVFkQclg4SGkYxDhLCtArS8RhzowFjMQIVq09pIcIoF\nbyDY3zkw41azc3n3UzfjbE4gea3ZYQp2Oqf4nh/VTn1j0y4GuiAKsRTQollPNrHa\nXRMq+83g4NW9rdE6rc1d\n=zt8T\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 88860d154a480edf389a555c23a9c9ad6a352425\nparent 711b31550286585b3793857b2a99c8dafd98b785\nauthor Quanzheng Long <long@langchain.dev> 1782240971 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782240971 -0700\n\nfix(langgraph): emit valid UUIDs for exit-mode delta task_ids for langgraph-api (#8165)\n\nFix exit-mode DeltaChannel `PutWrites` task IDs so they remain valid RFC\nUUIDs while preserving superstep ordering for `ORDER BY task_id, idx`.\n\nFollow-up to #7730: `_put_exit_delta_writes` used `f\"{step:08d}-{tid}\"`,\nwhich produces a 6-segment string Postgres rejects for\n`checkpoint_writes.task_id uuid` (e.g. `invalid input syntax for type\nuuid`) in LangGraph-API.\n\nThis new `exit_delta_task_id()` helper embeds the superstep in the first\nUUID group and keeps the original task UUID in the remaining segments\n(e.g. `00000001-0270-bf16-1ef8-fb321bef9f3d`).\n\n**Breaking changes:** None.\n\n**Verification:**\n- `cd libs/langgraph && make format && make lint && make test\nTEST=\"tests/test_delta_channel_exit_mode.py\"` (12 passed)\n- New unit test asserts synthetic IDs parse as UUID, sort by superstep,\nand that the old format is invalid\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Quanzheng Long <prclqz@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <215916821+open-swe[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-23T18:56:12Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/commits/8c9d59c842454e7f4531f5e69ff9dab0af3c660f","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langgraph/commit/8c9d59c842454e7f4531f5e69ff9dab0af3c660f","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/commits/8c9d59c842454e7f4531f5e69ff9dab0af3c660f/comments","author":null,"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"711b31550286585b3793857b2a99c8dafd98b785","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/commits/711b31550286585b3793857b2a99c8dafd98b785","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langgraph/commit/711b31550286585b3793857b2a99c8dafd98b785"}]},{"sha":"711b31550286585b3793857b2a99c8dafd98b785","node_id":"C_kwDOKFU0ldoAKDcxMWIzMTU1MDI4NjU4NWIzNzkzODU3YjJhOTljOGRhZmQ5OGI3ODU","commit":{"author":{"name":"dependabot[bot]","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-06-19T10:05:18Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-19T10:05:18Z"},"message":"chore(deps): bump langchain-anthropic from 1.0.0a5 to 1.4.6 in /libs/cli/examples/graph_prerelease_reqs in the pip group across 1 directory (#8145)\n\nBumps the pip group with 1 update in the\n/libs/cli/examples/graph_prerelease_reqs directory:\n[langchain-anthropic](https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain).\n\nUpdates `langchain-anthropic` from 1.0.0a5 to 1.4.6\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/releases\">langchain-anthropic's\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>langchain-anthropic==1.4.6</h2>\n<p>Changes since langchain-anthropic==1.4.5</p>\n<p>release(anthropic): 1.4.6 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38105\">#38105</a>)\nfix(langchain,anthropic): confine file-search results and tighten\nanthropic <code>allowed_prefixes</code> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38106\">#38106</a>)\nrelease(core): 1.4.6 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38061\">#38061</a>)\nfeat(core,partners): add package version tracking to tracing metadata\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/35295\">#35295</a>)\nchore(infra): bump mypy to 2.1 and unify type-check config across the\nmonorepo (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/36470\">#36470</a>)\nfeat(standard-tests): validate tool call chunks during streaming (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/34707\">#34707</a>)\ntest(anthropic): make expected warnings explicit (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38044\">#38044</a>)\ntest(anthropic): make tests robust to gateway base URL (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38043\">#38043</a>)</p>\n<h2>langchain-anthropic==1.4.5</h2>\n<p>Changes since langchain-anthropic==1.4.4</p>\n<p>release(anthropic): 1.4.5 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38036\">#38036</a>)\nfix(core): support content block tokens in callbacks (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/34739\">#34739</a>)\nchore(model-profiles): refresh model profile data (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/38012\">#38012</a>)\nhotfix(openai): min core dep (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/37990\">#37990</a>)\ntest(langchain,partners): disable pytest-benchmark under xdist to\nsilence <code>PytestBenchmarkWarning</code> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/37901\">#37901</a>)\nchore(model-profiles): refresh model profile data (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/37895\">#37895</a>)\nchore(model-profiles): refresh model profile data (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/37771\">#37771</a>)</p>\n<h2>langchain-anthropic==1.4.4</h2>\n<p>Changes since langchain-anthropic==1.4.3</p>\n<p>release(anthropic): 1.4.4 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/37757\">#37757</a>)\nfix(anthropic): normalize cross-provider tool-call IDs (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/37756\">#37756</a>)\ntest(anthropic): retry integration tests on transient failures (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/37697\">#37697</a>)\nchore(infra): bump <code>langchain-tests</code> floor to 1.1.9 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/37610\">#37610</a>)\nchore: bump langsmith from 0.8.3 to 0.8.5 in /libs/partners/anthropic\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/37564\">#37564</a>)\nchore: bump idna from 3.11 to 3.15 in /libs/partners/anthropic (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/37565\">#37565</a>)\nci(infra): harden Dependabot version-bound preservation (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/37510\">#37510</a>)\nchore(infra): merge v1.4 into master (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/37350\">#37350</a>)\nchore: bump urllib3 from 2.6.3 to 2.7.0 in /libs/partners/anthropic (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/37343\">#37343</a>)\nchore: bump requests from 2.33.0 to 2.33.1 in /libs/partners/anthropic\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/37286\">#37286</a>)\nchore: bump langsmith from 0.7.31 to 0.8.3 in /libs/partners/anthropic\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/37287\">#37287</a>)\nchore: bump langchain-core from 1.3.2 to 1.3.3 in\n/libs/partners/anthropic (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/37288\">#37288</a>)</p>\n<h2>langchain-anthropic==1.4.3</h2>\n<p>Changes since langchain-anthropic==1.4.2</p>\n<p>release(anthropic): 1.4.3 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/37166\">#37166</a>)\nrefactor(langchain-classic): retarget deprecations to\n<code>create_agent</code>, other chores (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/37164\">#37164</a>)\nchore(docs): update x handle references (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues/37081\">#37081</a>)\nfix(anthropic): guard httpx finalizers (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/issues