","date":"2026-06-19T08:28:38Z"},"message":"chore(deps): bump tornado from 6.5.6 to 6.5.7 in /libs/langgraph (#8108)\n\nBumps [tornado](https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado) from 6.5.6 to\n6.5.7.\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/blob/master/docs/releases.rst\">tornado's\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h1>Release notes</h1>\n<p>.. toctree::\n:maxdepth: 2</p>\n<p>releases/v6.5.7\nreleases/v6.5.6\nreleases/v6.5.5\nreleases/v6.5.4\nreleases/v6.5.3\nreleases/v6.5.2\nreleases/v6.5.1\nreleases/v6.5.0\nreleases/v6.4.2\nreleases/v6.4.1\nreleases/v6.4.0\nreleases/v6.3.3\nreleases/v6.3.2\nreleases/v6.3.1\nreleases/v6.3.0\nreleases/v6.2.0\nreleases/v6.1.0\nreleases/v6.0.4\nreleases/v6.0.3\nreleases/v6.0.2\nreleases/v6.0.1\nreleases/v6.0.0\nreleases/v5.1.1\nreleases/v5.1.0\nreleases/v5.0.2\nreleases/v5.0.1\nreleases/v5.0.0\nreleases/v4.5.3\nreleases/v4.5.2\nreleases/v4.5.1\nreleases/v4.5.0\nreleases/v4.4.3\nreleases/v4.4.2\nreleases/v4.4.1\nreleases/v4.4.0\nreleases/v4.3.0\nreleases/v4.2.1\nreleases/v4.2.0\nreleases/v4.1.0\nreleases/v4.0.2\nreleases/v4.0.1\nreleases/v4.0.0\nreleases/v3.2.2\nreleases/v3.2.1</p>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/commit/48fc2d43d1f48b8b3b0be5dcf6a7634c6f45b1c4\"><code>48fc2d4</code></a>\nMerge pull request <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/issues/3633\">#3633</a>\nfrom bdarnell/curl-reset-65</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/commit/4ae1ddd14245e56e9fb6fb14d4b9508301fbb841\"><code>4ae1ddd</code></a>\nRelease notes and version bump for 6.5.7</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/commit/3154caabc9a60cb0b6953d28877b2785fbd3ab43\"><code>3154caa</code></a>\ncurl_httpclient: Reset the curl object before putting it on the\nfreelist</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/commit/7d869c0739b264797ef92b6aa4a80c54b5993ea2\"><code>7d869c0</code></a>\nMerge pull request <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/issues/3631\">#3631</a>\nfrom bdarnell/cve-links</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/commit/288241f6812bb7204984573e55de21d17af951f3\"><code>288241f</code></a>\ndocs: Use the correct link syntax</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/commit/8da981c0f614f63d9d3b2cd5017db2b40e5642f6\"><code>8da981c</code></a>\ndocs: Add CVE links to 6.5.6 release notes</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/compare/v6.5.6...v6.5.7\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility\nscore](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=tornado&package-manager=uv&previous-version=6.5.6&new-version=6.5.7)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't\nalter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting\n`@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits\nthat have been made to it\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all\nof the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the\nPR or upgrade to it yourself)\nYou can disable automated security fix PRs for this repo from the\n[Security Alerts\npage](https://github.com/langchain-ai/langgraph/network/alerts).\n\n</details>\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"104c1b910603e2b004d07d2d72c5d753c2eee1e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/git/trees/104c1b910603e2b004d07d2d72c5d753c2eee1e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/git/commits/510d943362a7fde63a74855ac51418d6f1bc3768","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqNP22CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzkEQAIjU1JU0tJTtrmCVAmPX9PNX\nd23aO8M6piRxPTn2Z/THiSAnrhyDsr2iPoO41mQl1Af6JEff51s7966rqbcbfFZw\nNL1IZgnsdBCF8nADqvCgQxfQ/mNM53zyPs1NkXBrz0GVCUPr5qa+qpFM9F5nXVpu\nClnDshsFNq+044zqsa9xCyAKvhX+n2gi33MHuQK3v1uSOFU2Az7PYgKzsj0OaPPT\nz4qQjRaWMdl4bIwiZL+HpkqflzUZKxrpgZrZShbxrVWNXp/okwYSxB9YlUW+C8qt\nPwH6kHitniXQ7ZcschRB3U+2JhHhyjlYx2iNct1fOpcimOFWgCZ214VkU/hAlODC\ntQjH+1ixlEVVOPimxWjHSvDDc4N5/9QYa3cbEyqRxmWPTstEnV5IC+kobvaUPGis\noxRsWcBNo2+6uGtV1GxWzwllcNomtbWXYtHaZshMXlUGktVfBmbbsmptzlaHftsD\n+tAWbGSeqkOXYEVxScK0Uh6NLC+5PXqRx67YTAET4BrA581hhUJusZ8mVAJypcGH\ntyJzQzEtKIw1A8AMpdSaDwkLQZN98zyP3BIvYGep9ba6VAS3/loy/CVjNNb8C+py\nD3dJ3Xy8UP6BXjD3XUVRwkfpog/Oz3qmbzF/8X49B9PT7xqpLEGUzr39yoVV3D2d\n3yVfKxlzg3io2IGt4DG1\n=8x8a\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 104c1b910603e2b004d07d2d72c5d753c2eee1e5\nparent a4157ef280b236aecc331a7a17d7695d9e0e95e9\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1781857718 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781857718 -0700\n\nchore(deps): 